# Firm outreach emails — Police Station Agent

**Do not send firm outreach emails from `policestationagent`.**

- Permanent kill-switch: `lib/firm-outreach/outreach-emails-disabled.ts` (`PSA_OUTREACH_EMAILS_DISABLED = true`)
- Prospect/firm sends (cron, admin manual/bulk, Kent corrections, approval links) must stay blocked
- **Policestationrepuk** WhatsApp / firm invite outreach remains active — do not disable that site
- **Also:** RepUK historically sent `agent_cover_kent_v1` (Police Station Agent–branded) mail via its dual-campaign cron (`*/15`). That path is killed in Policestationrepuk (`AGENT_COVER_EMAILS_DISABLED` / `OUTREACH_SEND_CAMPAIGN_IDS`)
- Do not set `FIRM_OUTREACH_FORCE_SEND=true` or flip the kill-switch to `false` unless the user explicitly asks to resume PSA outreach
- Owner digests (to Rob) may still run; emails **to firms** must not
